### Statistics for the last year (default period)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics?symbols=AAPL,MSFT,VOO,BND,GLD

> {%
    client.test("Statistics computed", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected HTTP 200");
        client.assert(response.body.symbols.length === 5, "Expected 5 assets");
        client.assert(response.body.correlation[0][0] === 1, "Diagonal of the correlation matrix must be 1");
    });
%}

### Same request again (should be served from the cache, noticeably faster)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics?symbols=AAPL,MSFT,VOO,BND,GLD

### Explicit period, lower-case symbols and a duplicate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics?symbols=aapl,voo,AAPL&from=2025-01-01&to=2026-06-30

### Unknown symbol (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics?symbols=AAPL,NOPE

### Inverted period (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics?symbols=AAPL&from=2026-06-30&to=2025-01-01

### Period without enough prices (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics?symbols=AAPL&from=2020-01-01&to=2020-01-31